    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a heavy thing to say. it just feels like i've lost all my agency. i can't even walk to the mailbox without getting winded, and my mind is getting fuzzy. i'm just a passenger in this body now, watching it fail. it feels so undignified, just decaying slowly.",
